  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Plastic use in the flower sector of Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainability in the floriculture sector is a growing concern in Colombia, particularly around plastics. Within the sector, there is a need for more knowledge and know-how around sustainability practices. This study presents the current situation and possible solutions related to circularity practices related to plastic packaging in the Colombian flowers sector. It also explores the possibilities for cooperation between Dutch and Colombian stakeholders.Furthermore, this study forms the basis for a pilot on the topic, by providing recommendations for follow up actions.</narrative>
  </description>
